	 * Parses the given string, decoding and replacing all recognized 
	 * XML entities. A ParseError is thrown if any entity is invalid 
	 * or if a special charactar is encountered.   
	 * 
	 * @param string
	 * @param location
	 * @return
	 * @throws ParseError
	 */
